| `secrets.scanner.release_url` | string | `https://github.com/gitleaks/gitleaks/releases/download/v8.30.1` | an https URL with a host and a valid port if any, or a `file:///` URL, with no `@`, `?`, `#`, backslash, whitespace or control character | `scripts/install_scanner.py`, through `scripts/config_loader.py`'s `secrets.scanner.release_url` row | Names the one place the archive file name is joined to, so a mirror that holds the same files repoints the install with this value alone; the sha256 check is the same whatever it names. A URL that cannot be read is exit 11, naming it. Required: absent, the installer is exit 14 naming this key. | an http mirror, which it refuses | always |
